-- akn:preamble/p3 Its wages and labour-agreements division; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The circular's number, הע/48/89(111); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The addressee, the deputy Accountant-General; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The subject line: the teaching employees' agreement of 15.5.89; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The sign-off; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The signature; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The signer's name, Yaakov Danon; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p20 His post, the Commissioner of Wages and Labour Agreements; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p21 "Copies:"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p22 Copy to the Civil Service Commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p23 Copy to the Ministry of Education's director-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p24 Copy to the Histadrut's trade-union department; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p25 Copy to the budgets commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p26 Copy to the deputy wages commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p27 Copy to the local government's deputy director-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p28 The typist's reference; no rule.

@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5
`the circular distributing the 1989 agreement was issued on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 21 5 1989

-- Letter ¶1: the agreement was signed on 15.5.89 for 1988–90 and is
-- attached as the circular's annex א'. ¶2: under its §5 a new salary table
-- applies from 1.6.88 (annex ב'). ¶3: under its §6 allowances and payments
-- are updated. Each restates the agreement, encoded where it rules.
-- akn:preamble/p9 Letter ¶1: the agreement, its parties and years, attached as annex א'; encoded at preamble/p31.
-- akn:preamble/p10 Letter ¶2: §5's new table from 1.6.88; encoded at art_5.
-- akn:preamble/p11 Letter ¶3: §6's allowances; encoded at art_6.

-- Letter ¶4: the current payments and the arrears are paid in the May 1989
-- salary and no later than the June 1989 salary, each month's arrears at
-- that month's prices. ¶5: the advances paid from November 1988 (circular
-- הע/88/65(1/89), outside the corpus) are set off against them. The same as
-- the agreement's §13, which rules them below.
-- akn:preamble/p12 Letter ¶4: paid in May, at the latest June 1989; as §13 rules it.
-- akn:preamble/p13 Letter ¶4: each month's arrears at that month's salary prices; as §13's "בהתאם לתחולת הסעיפים".
-- akn:preamble/p14 Letter ¶5: the November 1988 advances are set off; as §13 rules it.

-- Letter ¶6–¶7: the agreement applies to the budgetary pensioners, and not
-- to the employees of government companies, whom the Government Companies
-- Authority instructs.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the 1989 agreement applies to budgetary pensioners` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:preamble/p16
`the 1989 agreement applies to government companies' employees` MEANS FALSE

