-- Each table prints the monthly combined salary of a full position, a row
-- per year of seniority (1 to 33, printed at both edges) and a column per
-- grade under the "דרגות" band, in the order the header prints them. The
-- labels beside its first two rows say what they are: row 1 the starting
-- combined salary ("מש. משולבת תחילית"), the rest by seniority ("מש.
-- משולבת לפי ותק"). A row is the year the teacher is in (convention
-- thresholds.seniority); none is made up past 33 (convention
-- thresholds.missing-row). A cell the scan does not settle is NOTHING
-- here, never filled from the factor the tables step by.
